<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.0 billion 21-day yields avg 3.873 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.0 billion 21-day yields avg 3.873 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said its C$1.0 billion auction of 21-day T-bills due October 10 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD</p>
<p>			  AVG   3.873   PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    3.840   HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    3.900   76.27548</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on September 19.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
